        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "690e416d-610a-5c1c-bb7d-4e4504579305",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Kung Fu Magoo\n- People: Millard Kaufman, John Hubley, Dylan Sprouse, Cole Sprouse, Alyson Stoner, Tom Kenny, Rodger Bumpass, Jim Conroy, Chris Parnell, Maile Flanagan\n- Topics: Mr. Magoo, voice cast\n\nFacts:\n- Kung Fu Magoo is a Mexican-American animated action comedy film based on the Mr. Magoo character.\n- Mr. Magoo was created by Millard Kaufman and John Hubley.\n- The English voice cast of Kung Fu Magoo includes Dylan Sprouse, Cole Sprouse, Alyson Stoner, Tom Kenny, Rodger Bumpass, Jim Conroy, Chris Parnell, and Maile Flanagan.\n- Maile Flanagan was born on May 19, 1965.\n- Maile Flanagan is an American actress.\n- Maile Flanagan is best known for voicing Naruto Uzumaki in the English version of Naruto and for playing Terry Perry on Lab Rats.\n- Maile Flanagan has also had recurring roles on Shameless, Bad Teacher, The Class, Grey's Anatomy, and many cartoons.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
