        "original_id": "37752a70-d090-5f6d-b86e-eacbad543db0",
        "text": "Page: Kung Fu Magoo. Sentence: Kung Fu Magoo is a Mexican-American animated action comedy film based on the \"Mr. Magoo\" character, created by Millard Kaufman and John Hubley.\nPage: Kung Fu Magoo. Sentence: English voice-cast stars Dylan and Cole Sprouse, Alyson Stoner and voice actors Tom Kenny, Rodger Bumpass, Jim Conroy, Chris Parnell, and Maile Flanagan.\nPage: Maile Flanagan. Sentence: Maile Flanagan (born May 19, 1965) is an American actress, best known for her roles as Naruto Uzumaki (English version) in \"Naruto\", as Terry Perry on \"Lab Rats\", and has had recurring roles on \"Shameless\", \"Bad Teacher\", \"The Class\", \"Grey's Anatomy\" and many cartoons.",
